TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Az önce fark ettim, 29 Şubat sadece
artık yıllarda geliyor!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}} Bu kadar nadir
bir gün daha tantanalı olmalı bence.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
Artık Gün Festivali falan yapmalıyız!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}
Eyvah! Hiç hazırlığımız yok!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}A normal year has 365 days, right?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
And this year is a leap year, so it
has 366 days!
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Talking about it gets me super
excited about time and space and
stuff like that!{{TAG:0009:0000:03000400}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Normal yıl 365 gün, değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Bu yıl artık yıl, yani 366 gün!
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Böyle konuşunca zaman, uzay falan
düşünmek acayip heyecan veriyor!{{TAG:0009:0000:03000400}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ack! It's a leap year! {{TAG:0003:001B:}}And of course
I'm totally unprepared. But what is
there to do, really?{{TAG:0009:0001:080009000A00}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}¡Ay, que es año bisiesto! {{TAG:0003:001B:}}¡Y yo aquí
tan pancha como si nada! Aunque...
¿qué hay que hacer exactamente?{{TAG:0009:0001:080009000A00}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Mince, c'est une année bissextile !
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Et bien sûr, chuis pas prête... Mais
prête pour quoi, au juste ?{{TAG:0009:0001:080009000A00}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ah! Questo è un anno bisestile! {{TAG:0003:001B:}}E
io sono come sempre impreparata.
Ma che c'è da fare in realtà?{{TAG:0009:0001:080009000A00}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}So ein Käse!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Wir haben ja 'n
Schaltjahr! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Und ich hab's
natürlich total verpeilt!{{TAG:0009:0001:080009000A00}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Amanın! Artık yılmış! {{TAG:0003:001B:}} Tabii ben yine
hazırlıksız yakalandım. Gerçi buna
nasıl hazırlanılır ki?{{TAG:0009:0001:080009000A00}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}It's cool that leap days only come
once every four years, but that's
pretty much all there is to 'em!{{TAG:0009:0001:080009000A00}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Es un pasote que sea año bisiesto
solo cada cuatro... Pero aparte de
eso, ¡tampoco es para tanto!{{TAG:0009:0001:080009000A00}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}À part tomber une fois tous les
quatre ans, ces jours bissextils sont
vraiment d'aucune utilité !{{TAG:0009:0001:080009000A00}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Gli anni bisestili capitano una volta
ogni quattro anni, sì... non c'è altro
da dire a riguardo!{{TAG:0009:0001:080009000A00}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}J'aurais sans doute dû réfléchir à un
truc quatre ans plus tôt...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

EN:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Maybe I'll start working on some
stuff to do for the leap day that
happens four years from now{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Forse posso cominciare a pensare
adesso a cosa fare per il prossimo
anno bisestile{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Belki dört yıl sonraki Artık Gün için
şimdiden bir şeyler planlamaya
başlarım{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}It's not like other events where
everyone buys clothes and presents
and bakes cookies, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ça vaut pas les autres fêtes où les
gens s'déguisent ou font la popote,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Questo qui non è come gli altri
eventi, in cui si comprano regali o
si preparano biscotti, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Diğer etkinlikler gibi herkesin kıyafet,
hediye alıp kurabiye yaptığı bir gün
değil sonuçta, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
